# DESK08 -- the dialog chain on the running kernel desktop (sd-base, no #Z).
# Ticks are 200 Hz after "[desk] desktop up" armed the injector.
# A: idle, the boot picture.
# Hover the Options title (x 160..232) -> B, the box open.
# Click "Set background..." -- entry 0, y = 19..35, centre 27 -> C, the dialog.
#    `form_center` must put the 300x180 box at ((640-300)/2, 19+(480-19-180)/2)
#    = (170,159); the desk's old `(480-180)/2` would have been y = 150.
# Click its Cancel button -- object 11 at (178,138,90,28) inside the box, i.e.
#    (348,297,90,28) on screen -> click (393,311). `end_dialog` takes the box
#    down again; D must be pixel-identical to A.
200 parkbr
1000 arm
1100 mark A_IDLE
1400 move 196 8
1800 mark B_OPTIONS
2100 move 200 27
2300 down
2303 up
2600 parkbr
3000 mark C_DIALOG
3300 move 393 311
3500 down
3503 up
3800 parkbr
4200 mark D_CLOSED
